Third-party notices for hocket-core's AutoMix analysis (feature `automix-analysis`)
==================================================================================

The beat and downbeat tracker is "Beat This!" (Foscarin, Schlüter, Widmer,
ISMIR 2024; https://github.com/CPJKU/beat_this), run through its Rust port
beat-this-rs (https://github.com/danigb/beat-this-rs, crate `beat-this` 1.1.0).

models/mel_spectrogram.onnx and models/beat_this_small.onnx are copied
unchanged from beat-this-rs at revision 1ae768e78f1ad83b0ed3886241dc29ffde853c40
(the commit crate 1.1.0 was published from). They are converted from the
"small1" Beat This! checkpoint and embedded into the binary.

