The singing-voice detector is musicnn (Pons & Serra, "musicnn: Pre-trained
convolutional neural networks for music audio tagging", ISMIR 2019 LBD;
https://github.com/jordipons/musicnn), its "MTT_musicnn" model (trained on
MagnaTagATune; the repository reports ROC-AUC 0.907 on its test set).

models/musicnn_mtt.onnx is converted from the MTT_musicnn checkpoint shipped in
that repository at revision 516acb2a0ff5ef73f64547898e018e793152c506 by
scripts/musicnn-to-onnx.py (TensorFlow 2.15.1, tf2onnx 1.16.1, opset 13;
inference mode, sigmoid outputs). The graph and weights are otherwise unchanged.

  sha256 041f3935e981a65cea739842d30c188d3a7d2adf4410955c8668eb3de4a5acab  MTT_musicnn/.data-00000-of-00001
